{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shattered Chess</strong> is a fast, hypnotic roguelike remix of chess. You get <strong>10 moves</strong> to beat a <strong>target score</strong>. Enemy pieces are scattered and don\u2019t move\u2014your job is to <strong>chain captures</strong> for massive <strong>combos</strong>. Miss a capture and the chain breaks. Between fights, visit the <strong>shop</strong> to buy/upgrade passives and effects, then face <strong>unique bosses</strong> that warp the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW IT PLAYS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick a King Challenge</strong> \u2013 a difficulty modifier that applies a <strong>run-long drawback</strong> (no player bonus) and forces you to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/fa7bf7765958f2658ee7f00891bb4b9a.poster.avif?t=1771869019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/fa7bf7765958f2658ee7f00891bb4b9a.webm?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/fa7bf7765958f2658ee7f00891bb4b9a.mp4?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan 10 moves</strong> \u2013 every decision matters; find the most optimal routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain captures</strong> \u2013 take multiple pieces in one combo to multiply your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/9f0553c0d68a6531abe9e3b12c082706.poster.avif?t=1771869019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/9f0553c0d68a6531abe9e3b12c082706.webm?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/9f0553c0d68a6531abe9e3b12c082706.mp4?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooldown matters</strong> \u2013 a capturing piece goes on a <strong>1-move cooldown</strong>, so rotate your lineup or build around reducing/offsetting cooldowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat the target</strong> \u2013 hit or exceed the enemy\u2019s score to win the match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop between fights</strong> \u2013 buy and upgrade passives/effects to overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss encounters</strong> \u2013 every few stages, a boss changes the rules in surprising ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/5d2cdfef0e6a1a61349b584cb6366063.poster.avif?t=1771869019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/5d2cdfef0e6a1a61349b584cb6366063.webm?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/5d2cdfef0e6a1a61349b584cb6366063.mp4?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless mode</strong> \u2013 after a successful run, push your luck and climb as far as you can.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILDCRAFTING</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialize or diversify</strong> \u2013 invest in passives that boost one piece type, or get rewarded for switching between different pieces within the same combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/e3f7f796c6a0dde30b2dae5e69562cc6.poster.avif?t=1771869019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/e3f7f796c6a0dde30b2dae5e69562cc6.webm?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/e3f7f796c6a0dde30b2dae5e69562cc6.mp4?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanic-focused builds</strong> \u2013 stack <strong>cooldown reduction</strong> or <strong>zone effects</strong> that boost your score when you plan and play around them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mitigate the drawback</strong> \u2013 draft passives/effects that help you bypass the negatives of your <strong>King Challenge</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/4c90757177ec236dcb6eff2d3cc1f0a4.poster.avif?t=1771869019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/4c90757177ec236dcb6eff2d3cc1f0a4.webm?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/4c90757177ec236dcb6eff2d3cc1f0a4.mp4?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess-inspired roguelike with quick, satisfying runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo-driven scoring</strong> that rewards creative planning and risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful passives &amp; synergies</strong> for expressive builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique bosses</strong> that push you to think differently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric <strong>2D pixel art</strong> with a moody, light horror-tinged vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly replayable</strong>: new enemy layouts and builds every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/e648260d39bb4401195a60e289fb0108.avif?t=1771869019\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras_big/e648260d39bb4401195a60e289fb0108.webp?t=1771869019 width=1560 height=227 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131940?t=1771869019","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/5a361c516e1e38e9aaf4469e4736bd428d5e6ee1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771869019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/3fa63ddbc9a85ac444d16bcbf1a48b08fa5c2d3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771869019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/3fa63ddbc9a85ac444d16bcbf1a48b08fa5c2d3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771869019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4134560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Demo available now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the core loop: chain captures for big combos, visit the shop, and face a rule-twisting boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build around piece types or cooldown mechanics and see how far your route planning goes.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shattered Chess</strong> is a fast, hypnotic roguelike remix of chess. You get <strong>10 moves</strong> to beat a <strong>target score</strong>. Enemy pieces are scattered and don\u2019t move\u2014your job is to <strong>chain captures</strong> for massive <strong>combos</strong>. Miss a capture and the chain breaks. Between fights, visit the <strong>shop</strong> to buy/upgrade passives and effects, then face <strong>unique bosses</strong> that warp the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW IT PLAYS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick a King Challenge</strong> \u2013 a difficulty modifier that applies a <strong>run-long drawback</strong> (no player bonus) and forces you to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/fa7bf7765958f2658ee7f00891bb4b9a.poster.avif?t=1771869019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/fa7bf7765958f2658ee7f00891bb4b9a.webm?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/fa7bf7765958f2658ee7f00891bb4b9a.mp4?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan 10 moves</strong> \u2013 every decision matters; find the most optimal routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain captures</strong> \u2013 take multiple pieces in one combo to multiply your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/9f0553c0d68a6531abe9e3b12c082706.poster.avif?t=1771869019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/9f0553c0d68a6531abe9e3b12c082706.webm?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/9f0553c0d68a6531abe9e3b12c082706.mp4?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooldown matters</strong> \u2013 a capturing piece goes on a <strong>1-move cooldown</strong>, so rotate your lineup or build around reducing/offsetting cooldowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat the target</strong> \u2013 hit or exceed the enemy\u2019s score to win the match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop between fights</strong> \u2013 buy and upgrade passives/effects to overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss encounters</strong> \u2013 every few stages, a boss changes the rules in surprising ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/5d2cdfef0e6a1a61349b584cb6366063.poster.avif?t=1771869019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/5d2cdfef0e6a1a61349b584cb6366063.webm?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/5d2cdfef0e6a1a61349b584cb6366063.mp4?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless mode</strong> \u2013 after a successful run, push your luck and climb as far as you can.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILDCRAFTING</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialize or diversify</strong> \u2013 invest in passives that boost one piece type, or get rewarded for switching between different pieces within the same combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/e3f7f796c6a0dde30b2dae5e69562cc6.poster.avif?t=1771869019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/e3f7f796c6a0dde30b2dae5e69562cc6.webm?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/e3f7f796c6a0dde30b2dae5e69562cc6.mp4?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanic-focused builds</strong> \u2013 stack <strong>cooldown reduction</strong> or <strong>zone effects</strong> that boost your score when you plan and play around them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mitigate the drawback</strong> \u2013 draft passives/effects that help you bypass the negatives of your <strong>King Challenge</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/4c90757177ec236dcb6eff2d3cc1f0a4.poster.avif?t=1771869019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/4c90757177ec236dcb6eff2d3cc1f0a4.webm?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/4c90757177ec236dcb6eff2d3cc1f0a4.mp4?t=1771869019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess-inspired roguelike with quick, satisfying runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo-driven scoring</strong> that rewards creative planning and risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful passives &amp; synergies</strong> for expressive builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique bosses</strong> that push you to think differently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric <strong>2D pixel art</strong> with a moody, light horror-tinged vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly replayable</strong>: new enemy layouts and builds every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras/e648260d39bb4401195a60e289fb0108.avif?t=1771869019\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/extras_big/e648260d39bb4401195a60e289fb0108.webp?t=1771869019 width=1560 height=227 /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Arti Works"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131940/778b31c3f726f01e4da710e79d69ca7b70e42477/header.jpg?t=1771869019","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Arti Works. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nShattered Chess\u2122 is a trademark of Arti Works.<br />\r\nNot affiliated with or endorsed by any chess organization.<br />\r\nMade with Unity\u00ae. Unity is a trademark of Unity Technologies.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://vid